// Wave shape: Dans_Furathama
// Macro:  Wave(Dans_Furathama, "Samaan Ibrahim ", "saman153(at)hotmail.com", "", 1)
// Source: pixel/waveshort.sky.h:505
// Author: Samaan Ibrahim   <saman153(at)hotmail.com>
